acts with a shared, vault-aware Obsidian wikilink scanner, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note/alias/heading/block discovery, byte-exact replacements, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deterministic ranking, additive JSON metadata, documentation, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exhaustive Rust coverage while preserving existing capture behavior and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the lexical no-I/O guarantee of capture-parse.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Caret-correct link intelligence in Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]caret_integration[dim] · [dim][/dim]after link_protocol[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]caret_integration: update the linked bob-mac-capture app to decode the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]additive contract, drive completion from the real [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]AttributedTextSelection insertion point, preserve selection and IME [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]state while applying highlights, accept server-provided replacements [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with a restored caret, and harden cancellation, stale-response, Unicode,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and failure behavior with fixture-backed Swift tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Beautiful, accessible completion presentation and release gate[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual_polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after caret_integration[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual_polish: refine the popup's wikilink palette and completion rows [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into an adaptive native macOS experience with clear [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note/path/alias/subpath hierarchy, matched-result emphasis, keyboard and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]VoiceOver feedback, responsive sizing, documentation, automated [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]regression coverage, and a focused light/dark/high-contrast/IME [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]owner-assisted validation gate.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-n","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-n.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-9fa43c014f13e5a8af5ec9bb1b773045","started_at":"2026-08-14T15:06:18.065698+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"ecbb270f991ccb617db32ae04c629445f479c87acc2d34dd33a6a024ef1bb942","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-n.2/chat.md","size_bytes":18930},"commits":{"digest":"39e8fcf337ddb83a6954bf05f93fc2c8494f044a5cfa9b73bddc6cd471fb6847","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-n.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-n.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"0d58f194636ac38015d5c59a24ac7ba469d45ea89390744bc84a06f47bd649c0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-n.2/meta.json","size_bytes":660},"prompt":{"digest":"5d1589b1d6aadb69d1421be2604ac229e10dd0377024bf04e3f086960d066ac7","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-n.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":161},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"6d141b58c7133e089fee8bc72e44dbed0e5a0f0012ad9f4a527bbab70b47fbe5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-n.2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":23377},"state":{"digest":"28fea05fd78cf293ba6df3dd2abc3ddee8e8cf300452db66cf4e69947b4f0e28","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-n.2/state.json","size_bytes":183}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-n.2","local_name":"bob-cli-n.2","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-n","agent_clan_generation":"20260814110554","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-n.2","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-n","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-n.2","reasoning_effort":"xhig